# Curriculum Roadmap

- Single source of truth: `roadmap.ts` — 12 nodes with stages, paradigms, coordinate views
- Edges derived from `parents[]` — do not maintain separate `edges.ts`
- Paradigm values: `coord_free`, `coord_dep`, `both`
- Each node has `coordinate_free` and `coordinate_dependent` sections
- Content modules: `topics/<id>/` + register in `registry.ts` + add to `TOPICS_WITH_CONTENT` in `index.ts`
